   "comment": "releaseTime: release date not stated in the card; Hugging Face repo creation time used.\nacceptable_use_policy: Intended for research and educational use in accordance with Ai2's Responsible Use Guidelines (https://allenai.org/responsible-use); trained on third party datasets subject to academic and non-commercial research use only.\naccess_conditions: false\nadditional_assets: The Molmo2 datasets are available in the Molmo2 data collection on Hugging Face; the other artifacts (training code, evaluations, intermediate checkpoints) will be made available at a later date. All models in the Molmo2 family are in a Hugging Face collection.\narchitecture_details: Molmo2-8B is based on Qwen3-8B (language model) and uses SigLIP 2 as vision backbone. The card does not state layers, attention type, experts, active parameters, or design rationale.\nintegration_means: Used via Hugging Face transformers (AutoProcessor and AutoModelForImageTextToText with trust_remote_code=True), with transformers==4.57.1 and molmo_utils; inputs built with processor.apply_chat_template using chat messages containing text, video or image content; supports video QA, video pointing, tracking, multi-image QA and multi-image pointing.\nbase_model_relation: finetune"
